<title>PORTUGAL: Lisbon bourse ends suspension in Unicer.</title>
<headline>Lisbon bourse ends suspension in Unicer.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lisbon bourse ended a trading suspension on the shares of drinks company Unicer, dealers said.</p>
<p>Trade in the shares was suspended after a newspaper report said Unicer was interested in making a bid for sparkling water company Vidago.</p>
</text>
